===Etymology===
{{inh+|en|enm|entre}}, from {{der|en|fro|entree}} (feminine past participle of the verb {{m|fro|entrer}}, Modern {{cog|fr|entrée}}). From {{der|en|la|intrō}}. {{dbt|en|entrada|entrée}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{enPR|ĕnʹtrē}}, {{IPA|en|/ˈɛntɹi/}}
* {{audio|en|en-us-entry.ogg|a=US|q=female voice}}
* {{audio|en|LL-Q1860 (eng)-Back ache-entry.wav|a=UK|q=male voice}}
